    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You have developed an innate ability to sense when things are going badly, and thus can prepare yourself for the worst.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can always take a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a> during a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprise_Round\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprise Round\">Surprise Round</a>, even if you are <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprised\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprised\">Surprised</a>. If you are not <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprised\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprised\">Surprised</a>, you can take this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a> in addition to any other Actions you are normally allowed to take in the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprise_Round\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprise Round\">Surprise Round</a>.</p>",
